sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuario
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant AS as auth.store.js
    participant API as api.js
    participant BE as Backend

    Note over U,BE: === Login ===
    U->>FE: Ingresa email + password
    FE->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>BE: fetch()
    BE-->>API: {accessToken, refreshToken, user}
    API-->>FE: Response
    FE->>AS: setTokens() + setUser()
    AS->>AS: localStorage
    FE->>FE: navigate(/dashboard/home)

    Note over U,BE: === Token Expirado ===
    FE->>API: GET /clients (Bearer oldToken)
    API->>BE: fetch()
    BE-->>API: 401 Unauthorized
    API->>API: isRefreshing=true
    API->>BE: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken}
    BE-->>API: {accessToken, refreshToken}
    API->>AS: setToken(newAccessToken)
    API->>API: isRefreshing=false
    API->>API: reintenta request original
    BE-->>API: 200 OK

    Note over U,BE: === Google OAuth ===
    U->>FE: Click "Iniciar con Google"
    FE->>BE: window.location = /auth/google
    BE-->>U: Redirect Google consent
    U->>BE: Callback con code
    BE-->>FE: Redirect /auth/callback?token=...&refresh=...
    FE->>FE: Extrae tokens de URL
    FE->>AS: setTokens() + setUser()
    FE->>FE: navigate(/dashboard/home)
